add('H07','H Frontend','Low','Mobile sidebar and localized UX need work','frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/layout.tsx','useState(true)','Sidebar defaults to 240px at all breakpoints within a flex row; content at 390px competes for remaining width. Hardcoded English/date locale and no i18n system; contrast/hydration/bundle totals unmeasured.','Inspect w-60 and no mobile overlay breakpoint; utils.ts uses en-US. Verify full mobile workflow with authenticated screenshots.','Use collapsed/overlay mobile navigation and focus handling; introduce locale strategy when required and measure responsive layouts.')
add('I01','I Repo and DevOps','High','Dependency audit reports vulnerable installed trees','backend/package-lock.json','"node_modules/multer"','Backend registry audit reports 49 advisory entries (2 critical,12 high,31 moderate,4 low). Counts include transitive/meta-vulnerabilities and are not proven exploits. Frontend audit reports 73 entries (2 critical,16 high,54 moderate,1 low); see frontend-audit-escalated.json.','See backend-audit-escalated.json for exact versions, advisory URLs, ranges and remediation. Multer install warns version 1.x is vulnerable. Primary maintainer advisories: https://github.com/expressjs/multer/security/advisories (checked 2026-10-31).','Triage reachable production dependencies first; update minimally with contract/security regression tests and regenerate locks. Do not use audit fix --force blindly.')
