add('I04','I Repo and DevOps','High','Cluster ingress and collaboration scaling are incomplete','infrastructure/kubernetes/api.yaml','path: /api','API ingress routes only /api; /socket.io and /yjs fall through web ingress. API has 3–12 replicas but Hocuspocus has no cross-instance document fanout; Socket.io Redis adapter does not synchronize Yjs. Polling also needs stickiness.','Deploy manifests as written, request /yjs or /socket.io on ingress: routed to web. Connect two editors to different API pods: independent in-memory CRDT states overwrite persisted full snapshots. Runtime cluster reproduction unverified.','Route all protocols with TLS/timeouts; use supported cross-node Yjs persistence/fanout, sticky polling or documented websocket-only strategy and multi-pod convergence tests.')
