add('I06','I Repo and DevOps','High','Compose configuration cannot reproduce documented stack','docker-compose.yml','allkeys-lru','Redis configured allkeys-lru mixes durable queue/idempotency with evictable cache. No worker or migration service. Backend omits GROQ_API_KEY. Frontend runtime public vars/Clerk key are not supplied as Docker build args.','Inspect Compose and frontend Dockerfile: build declares only API/socket args and no Clerk key. New DB hits G02; AI backend key missing unless separately injected.','Separate durable queues from cache with noeviction, add explicit migration/worker lifecycle, supply public build config securely and health-based dependency startup.')
